# Database exports (scripts/db-dump.cjs) — berisi data produksi, jangan di-commit
/db-export/

# Files uploaded through the Sinkronisasi page (local source-file store for the
# file-based syncs). Real data — never commit.
sync-service/uploads/

# Master encryption key, written and rotated by the Keamanan settings page.
# NEVER commit this: it is the only thing standing between a leaked database
# dump and the plaintext behind every encrypted column. Losing it makes those
# values permanently unrecoverable, so back it up somewhere that is not git.
#
# Unanchored on purpose: each deployable mounts its own secrets/ dir
# (secrets/ at the root for the web app, sync-service/secrets/ for the sync
# service). A leading-path pattern only matches the root one, which left the
# sync service's copy of the SAME key untracked-but-committable.
**/secrets/*.key
**/secrets/*.key.*
